<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #b91c1c;">Your subscription is ending {{cancellation_date}}</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if recipient_name}} {{recipient_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>We've tried to collect <strong>{{amount_display}}</strong> several times now and weren't able to. Unless payment goes through by <strong>{{cancellation_date}}</strong>, your Growth Project subscription will end and your access will close{{#if coach_name}} &mdash; including the work you've been doing with {{coach_name}}{{/if}}.</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{billing_portal_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #b91c1c; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Update payment</a>
    </p>
    <p>If you'd rather let the subscription end, you can do that from the same page. Either way, we wanted to make sure you knew, so this isn't a quiet lapse on our end.</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Reply to this email if anything looks wrong &mdash; we'll sort it out.</p>
  </body>
</html>
